# R session artifacts
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user/

# Quarto
/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
/_site/

# NOTE: /_freeze/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
# Quarto stores executed chunk results there. Committing it means the site can be
# rebuilt (and published) without re-running R, and guarantees everyone sees the
# same numbers. Delete a folder under _freeze/ to force that page to re-execute.

# Legacy R Markdown output, if any survives
*.nb.html
*_files/
figure/

# IMPORTANT: R-Version/data/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# The course root .gitignore excludes "**/beta/", which is where the original
# supermarket_sales.xlsx lives. That means the primary dataset for this track is
# not in version control at its original location. The copy in R-Version/data/
# must therefore be committed, or students who clone the repository will have no
# data and setup.R will report the file as MISSING.
#
# Run setup.R once, then commit R-Version/data/.
